      },
      {
        "heading": "What markets drive Linquest's FY2026 obligations?",
        "body": "Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) is the largest market at $281M. Other material markets include All Other Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services at $24.1M and Engineering Services at $20.7M."
