      "a": "Linquest has obligated $326M in federal contract money in FY2026 to date. Linquest recorded 46 awards this fiscal year with an average award size of $7.1M, and obligations are down 12.5% year over year. Historical obligations by fiscal year include FY21 at $223M, FY22 at $162M, FY23 at $318M, FY24 at $308M, and FY25 at $372M."
